WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.740
Once upon a time there was a dragon named Seath, who was a bit of an ugly duckling.

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:09.740
His brothers all made fun of him. So he betrayed them and was rewarded by Gwyn.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:12.820
Seath had a thing for Gwyn's daughter, Gwynevere.

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:16.440
And one day, he stuck his crystal halberd into her Gaping Dragon.

00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:19.480
Nine months later, a child was born.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:20.940
'Priscilla'

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:26.540
Once Priscilla had grown to adulthood many of the gods realized that she was incredibly cute.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:30.520
She had a tail so fluffy that no mortal could resist petting it.

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:33.740
The gods recognized that she would bring many,

00:00:33.740 --> 00:00:34.240
The gods recognized that she would bring many, many,

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:34.740
The gods recognized that she would bring many, many, many

00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:36.740
The gods recognized that she would bring many, many, many one-quarter dragon babies into the world

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:38.020
and locked her away.

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:41.760
The Painted World is essentially a giant chastity belt.

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:46.120
But some adventurers could not resist Priscilla's allure and journeyed into the Painted World,

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:47.500
looking for their waifu.

00:00:50.205 --> 00:00:51.825
'Go back, go back!'

00:00:51.985 --> 00:00:55.965
But alas, adventurers could not go back. Because the exit was actually behind Priscilla.

00:00:55.965 --> 00:00:57.565
Kind of pointless, really.

00:00:57.565 --> 00:01:01.745
Why use them as warnings inside a place you can't even leave? Hm.

00:01:02.225 --> 00:01:05.585
Anyway, finally the Chosen Undead fulfils his mission.

00:01:05.885 --> 00:01:09.205
Every trial has led him here. And now he can claim his prize.

00:01:09.385 --> 00:01:12.145
He can now caress the tail of Priscilla.

00:01:12.505 --> 00:01:17.045
Many people believe that the true ending comes when you defeat Gwyn, but this is the real ending.

00:01:20.605 --> 00:01:23.245
Thou must returneth whence thou came.

00:01:23.385 --> 00:01:27.645
This land is peaceful, its inhabitants kind, but thou dost-

00:01:27.645 --> 00:01:28.885
This land is peaceful, its inhabitants kind, but thou dost-
- I'm sorry, what?!

00:01:28.885 --> 00:01:32.325
This land is peaceful, its inhabitants kind.

00:01:32.465 --> 00:01:34.465
Are you fucking kidding me?!

00:01:34.465 --> 00:01:36.465
You mean these guys?!

00:01:55.045 --> 00:01:58.225
Yeah, I guess they sure are fond of my souls, you bitch.

